# Response headers for statically-served files (Cloudflare's assets binding
# applies this file directly to requests it serves without running the
# Worker - vinext writes an auto-generated version of this file only when
# one is NOT already present, so this one is kept as-is). The server-rendered
# document ("/") is generated BY the Worker, not served from here, so the
# same header set is also applied there in code - see worker/index.ts.
#
# Do not add a Content-Security-Policy here: it is set once, correctly, in
# worker/index.ts, where its exact requirements (inline styles for progress
# bars, inline hydration-payload scripts) are documented next to it. Two
# independently-maintained copies would drift.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
